"""icons — one icon style for all our WP8.1 apps: a white Adwaita symbolic glyph on the app's flat colour.

  tools/icons preview            contact sheet in the scratch file given by $OUT (default /tmp/icons-preview.png)
  tools/icons tile-icons         Internet: the preset icons for pinned pages (apps/Browser/Browser/Assets/TileIcons)
  tools/icons apply [App ...]    write Assets\\*.scale-100/140/240.png, set the manifest colours, fix the project

The PNGs are transparent: the tile and app list use BackgroundColor="transparent", so the phone paints them in the
user's accent colour like the system apps; the splash screen and store logo keep the app colour.
Every size is rendered from the vector glyph (no upscaling: the old single
150x150 files were stretched 2.4x on the Lumia 1020 and looked blurry).
"""
